        "id": 3511154,
        "postDate": "2026-08-10T14:56:55.263Z",
        "rawMarkdown": "My v2 vs v3 test model had hard coded labeler.  I also attempted to use V3 in the plant competition that I referenced in the attached solution.  V3 did not perform as well there, but the training on v2 did sound like it had a lot more plant based input so the result made sense.   Gemini Pro tells me that V3 had a lot more medical images than v2 and that v3 should be the best choice.\n\nI do plan to repeat my evaluation when I get a model that is closer to 0.90. ",
        "content": "<p>My v2 vs v3 test model had hard coded labeler.  I also attempted to use V3 in the plant competition that I referenced in the attached solution.  V3 did not perform as well there, but the training on v2 did sound like it had a lot more plant based input so the result made sense.   Gemini Pro tells me that V3 had a lot more medical images than v2 and that v3 should be the best choice.</p>\n<p>I do plan to repeat my evaluation when I get a model that is closer to 0.90. </p>",
